---
description: Preserve ProtoMolt architecture and reuse its protobuf toolkit
alwaysApply: true
---

Read root AGENTS.md, especially "Start here: reuse and scope control" and
"Protobuf toolkit & zero-regex quick reference", before editing or delegating.
It is the canonical policy for every module.

Read docs/design/protobuf-toolkit-audit.md and relevant source-index entries.
Verify current branch and authorization. Cut issue and feature branches from
main; never push directly to main and leave ai-slop-archive-by-astra untouched.

Use existing descriptor mapping, CEL, projection, validation, zero-regex format
checkers (core/formats), parts and receipt machinery. For example, inspect
ProtoFieldMapper, CelProtoMapper, MessageProjection, ProtoValidator and
core/formats instead of converting a typed message through JSON or Struct or
using java.util.regex.

Never introduce a second public document API, authoritative JSON representation,
arbitrary document ceiling or weakened validation as an implementation shortcut.
Follow AGENTS.md for design changes, evidence and worker handoffs.
